      discoveryCostFree: 'Free',
      discoveryCta: 'Book on Cal.com',
      step1Closing: "A call can lead anywhere: a quick piece of advice or a targeted intervention. And if you need nothing, I'll tell you: that's a good outcome too.",
      // Step 2 — Targeted intervention
      step2Eyebrow: 'Step 2 · The intervention',
      step2Title: 'Targeted intervention',
      step2Subtitle: "One area, a result in hand: something that wasn’t there before and now works. Delivered within two weeks.",
      step2Body1: "We pick the area in the discovery call: observability, testing, deploy pipelines, access management or architecture. I go in there, figure out where to act, and bring the intervention.",
      step2DeliverableTitle: 'What you walk away with:',
      step2Deliverables: [
        'A concrete intervention on that area: something that wasn’t there before and now works',
        'A read of that area as a byproduct: what holds, what creaks, what’s missing',
        'The next moves, ordered by cost-to-risk ratio, to continue with me or on your own',
      ],
      step2Body2: "What I produce is yours, no lock-in. If we continue within 30 days, the €1,200 is credited to your first invoice. And if you’re not satisfied, I refund it: the work I did stays yours anyway.",
      step2DurationLabel: 'Duration',
